    {
      "key": "AirJumpButton",
      "type": "choice",
      "label": {
        "en": "Air jump: controller",
        "zh-Hans": "空中跳跃：手柄"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "The controller button that jumps in the air. R1 by default, the game's dodge. If you moved the dodge to another button, pick that one. The game's own action on that button still happens too: to avoid a clash, move it to another button in the game's controls or with a remapping mod.",
        "zh-Hans": "在空中跳跃所用的手柄按键。默认为 R1，即游戏的闪避键。如果你把闪避改到了其他按键，请选择那个按键。该按键在游戏中原有的功能也会同时触发：为避免冲突，请在游戏的按键设置中或用改键模组把该功能移到其他按键上。"
      },
